{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月13日晚間消息，聞泰科技發佈公告，披露安世中國收到荷蘭海牙地方法院商事庭臨時程序裁決，法院駁回Nexperia B.V．（安世荷蘭）商標侵權相關請求，不予批准在歐盟、比荷盧境內針對安世中國的商標臨時禁令。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586270.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T13:01:40.422522+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T12:52:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T12:55:00.034069+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T12:55:00.034069+00:00","content_hash":"9f207b64a6565f109b5d1ca82e6352f4d67545138058311fc2a7e9c552191252","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}